meta {
  name: Get Me
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/users/me
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  The caller's own profile. Expect 200 with id, email, name, bio, avatarUrl,
  hasAppleSignIn and createdAt.

  Note avatarUrl, never avatarKey — the R2 key is server-side only.

  email is null for an Apple user who chose to hide their address, and for an
  account created by the email-collision path. The iOS Profile screen renders
  "Hidden by Apple" rather than an empty row.
}
